      "fingerprint": "2bace4f9f4646dccaee47a2871fb102aac9404e1ddf403af5940f5ea102f5c22",
      "evidence": "Grete! Grete!\"\nshe then cried. \"Mother?\" his sister called from the other side.\nThey communicated across Gregor's room."
    },
    {
      "source_entity": "mother",
