      "label": "mère de",
      "category": "family",
      "evidence_chunk_id": "metamorphosis_ch01_p026",
      "fingerprint": "2bace4f9f4646dccaee47a2871fb102aac9404e1ddf403af5940f5ea102f5c22",
      "evidence": "\"Oh, God!\" called his mother, who was already in tears, \"he\ncould be seriously ill and we're making him suffer. Grete! Grete!\"\nshe then cried. \"Mother?\" his sister called from the other side.\nThey communicated across Gregor's room."
    },
    {
