      "fingerprint": "46b6ac9355d1cec4bed1541e7eb88321ba4017dd276c9ad1d227410f7caa29e4",
      "evidence": "Then the door of the bedroom opened and Mr. Samsa appeared in his uniform with\nhis wife on one arm and his daughter on the other. All of them had been crying\na little; Grete now and then pressed her face against her father's arm."
    },
    {
      "source_entity": "father",
      "target_entity": "mother",
      "label": "époux de",
